      Yahoo! would gain the advantage of being able to provide news services from
      a well-known source, while Reuters would be able to begin developing its own
      presence on the Internet. Unfortunately, since Yahoo! did not generate revenues,
      it was in a poor negotiating position. Talks between the two were cordial, but
      they also progressed very slowly.
