priceless brand and heritage. Purchasing software and hiring specialized person-
nel to digitize and properly archive their assets was a costly proposition that
lay beyond the core competence of most companies. Chris’s work with AGT
convinced her that there were literally thousands of companies with millions
of assets that would be interested in a company that would digitize and manage
their photo and video archives.
